WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.280 --> 01:37.960
=Episode 9=

01:59.680 --> 02:00.760
My eldest daughter

02:00.879 --> 02:01.959
has always been levelheaded.

02:02.920 --> 02:05.159
I'll save
this Hotan jade Guanyin of Fertility

02:05.519 --> 02:06.719
as a precious dowry piece for her.

02:07.920 --> 02:10.439
May it bless her with children
soon after marriage.

02:14.960 --> 02:16.360
My second daughter loves dressing up.

02:17.240 --> 02:18.960
This set of pure-gold hair ornaments

02:19.439 --> 02:20.439
will suit her perfectly.

02:21.439 --> 02:22.439
As for my third daughter,

02:22.439 --> 02:24.240
it's too early to prepare her dowry.

02:25.759 --> 02:27.199
I'll save this bolt of brocade

02:27.680 --> 02:28.599
for her.

02:29.319 --> 02:30.879
When she comes of age,

02:31.039 --> 02:31.800
I'll have her measured

02:31.800 --> 02:32.599
and make her a dress.

02:34.319 --> 02:35.919
She'll outshine every girl there.

02:36.919 --> 02:38.599
The dowries you've prepared, Madam,

02:38.599 --> 02:39.919
are already more than generous.

02:40.319 --> 02:42.879
Enough to set all three girls up
for life.

02:43.599 --> 02:44.560
Money...

02:44.879 --> 02:45.919
I can't guarantee it'll last.

02:46.599 --> 02:47.560
But at least

02:48.520 --> 02:51.240
I can leave them something
they can hold on to.

02:52.159 --> 02:54.599
Something they can keep close,

02:55.919 --> 02:57.199
and close to their hearts.

02:59.199 --> 03:00.680
Something to rely on and pass down,

03:01.120 --> 03:02.639
something that stays with them for life.

03:07.520 --> 03:12.000
(Cuifu Garden Poetry Gathering)

03:18.039 --> 03:20.240
Huizhou ink. Chengxintang paper.

03:20.759 --> 03:23.680
Miss Fan, you've made this
quite an elegant gathering.

03:24.319 --> 03:26.199
How lovely to see the geese fly south,

03:26.280 --> 03:27.960
while the great roc
soars across the vast skies.

03:28.240 --> 03:29.639
The southbound goose

03:30.039 --> 03:31.319
sets its sights afar.

03:31.520 --> 03:32.840
And the soaring roc

03:32.840 --> 03:33.919
rises straight to the heavens.

03:34.439 --> 03:37.319
What better way to celebrate
Mr. Yu's success in the exams?

03:37.840 --> 03:39.080
So this really is

03:39.080 --> 03:40.960
a celebration for Mr. Yu.

03:42.280 --> 03:44.280
Why not hold it at the Yu Residence?

03:47.319 --> 03:48.479
Madam Yu said

03:48.639 --> 03:49.879
we should keep things modest.

03:50.599 --> 03:51.439
Besides,

03:51.520 --> 03:52.800
they have a distant relative
staying with them,

03:52.879 --> 03:53.840
so they can't entertain guests.

03:54.639 --> 03:55.759
What distant relative?

03:58.639 --> 04:00.080
I don't know the details either.

04:00.360 --> 04:01.599
Come, everyone. Please take a seat.

04:01.919 --> 04:03.039
The autumn view is lovely,

04:03.360 --> 04:04.240
but you must be tired.

04:04.960 --> 04:05.759
- Please.
- Come on.

04:05.759 --> 04:06.479
Let's sit down.

04:06.479 --> 04:07.159
This way, please.

04:08.879 --> 04:09.639
Please, sit.

04:10.680 --> 04:11.120
Have a seat.

04:12.319 --> 04:13.840
It's such a beautiful day.

04:13.919 --> 04:15.639
I've prepared some pastries for you.

04:16.120 --> 04:17.079
Please, try them.

04:17.600 --> 04:20.399
These pastries are unusual.

04:22.000 --> 04:24.160
Madam sent these flower cakes
for Young Master.

04:24.600 --> 04:25.439
They're quite rare.

04:25.839 --> 04:26.680
I heard

04:26.680 --> 04:28.160
they came all the way from the capital.

04:28.600 --> 04:30.439
They're certainly hard to forget.

04:31.879 --> 04:32.879
There we go.

04:35.120 --> 04:36.279
They smell amazing.

04:37.759 --> 04:39.519
Crisp and not too sweet.

04:39.759 --> 04:41.800
I've tried every kind of pastry
you can imagine,

04:41.800 --> 04:43.639
but nothing this good.

04:43.879 --> 04:45.160
Even the shape

04:45.160 --> 04:46.360
is so distinctive.

04:46.680 --> 04:47.639
I think

04:47.639 --> 04:49.680
I've had these before in the capital.

04:50.319 --> 04:51.519
Good eye.

04:52.279 --> 04:53.319
These flower cakes

04:53.399 --> 04:55.079
can't be found anywhere in Yongning.

04:55.079 --> 04:55.959
They simply aren't sold here.

04:56.560 --> 04:58.759
Madam Yu couldn't attend

04:58.759 --> 05:00.040
because she's busy at home,

05:00.319 --> 05:01.639
so she had these specially sent

05:02.199 --> 05:03.800
for all of you to enjoy.

05:03.800 --> 05:05.600
Oh, please. They're not really for us.

05:05.759 --> 05:06.680
I'd say

05:06.680 --> 05:08.800
Madam Yu is simply doting
on you, Miss Fan,

05:08.800 --> 05:11.079
letting her future daughter-in-law
have a taste of something special.

05:11.560 --> 05:13.079
You always know how to tease me.

05:14.480 --> 05:15.759
(Even the shape)

05:15.759 --> 05:16.959
(is so distinctive.)

05:17.279 --> 05:18.199
(I think)

05:18.199 --> 05:20.240
(I've had these before in the capital.)

05:22.160 --> 05:23.519
I think

05:23.720 --> 05:24.959
I've had them too.

05:25.879 --> 05:27.319
Had what, Madam?

05:28.600 --> 05:29.279
The flower cakes.

05:30.360 --> 05:32.839
At a palace banquet when my husband
returned to report on his post.

05:33.319 --> 05:34.560
(They have a distant relative
staying with them,)

05:34.920 --> 05:35.839
(so they can't entertain guests.)

05:35.920 --> 05:37.279
(This is Miss Xie.)

05:37.560 --> 05:39.920
(She's a close friend
of my future daughter-in-law.)

05:40.480 --> 05:41.199
(Madam,)

05:41.639 --> 05:43.360
(I'd like, on behalf of my fiance,
Mr. Zhao,)

05:43.720 --> 05:44.800
(to ask for a salt permit.)

05:44.920 --> 05:47.199
(She threw me over to chase
after an Imperial Envoy.)

05:47.199 --> 05:49.199
(Mr. Zhao came to Huaying on business.)

05:49.439 --> 05:51.639
(He falsely claimed
to be an Imperial Envoy.)

05:51.720 --> 05:54.519
(Mr. Zhao wields immense power.)

05:54.680 --> 05:55.959
(Once you miss,)

05:55.959 --> 05:57.639
(there'll be no more chance.)

06:01.040 --> 06:01.480
Quick!

06:01.839 --> 06:03.199
Go get my husband. Now.

06:03.279 --> 06:04.279
Yes, Madam.

06:07.040 --> 06:08.360
(I've dealt with men sent from above)

06:08.879 --> 06:10.800
(more times than I can count.)

06:11.399 --> 06:12.800
(Western Capital Salt Transport Bureau)
(But this one is different.)

06:13.399 --> 06:14.560
(He's from the imperial family.)

06:15.920 --> 06:17.600
Jiuweijiao is such a big shot.

06:18.040 --> 06:19.079
You did business with him

06:19.079 --> 06:20.199
and didn't even tell me?

06:20.399 --> 06:20.800
I...

06:21.319 --> 06:23.079
I had no idea he was an informant.

06:23.199 --> 06:24.800
Those two came through the Yu family,

06:25.279 --> 06:27.120
and so did the flower cakes.

06:27.120 --> 06:28.439
You see what's happening now?

06:28.959 --> 06:30.000
I told you before,

06:30.000 --> 06:31.279
with the heat on lately,

06:31.279 --> 06:32.319
I need you to be vigilant.

06:32.319 --> 06:34.079
Vigilant!

06:39.800 --> 06:40.399
Fine.

06:40.680 --> 06:42.000
If this blows up in our faces,

06:43.439 --> 06:44.879
you and the three girls

06:45.279 --> 06:46.319
are on your own.

06:49.319 --> 06:50.120
Master,

06:50.120 --> 06:51.199
I know I was wrong.

06:52.079 --> 06:53.759
But we're in this together.

06:53.759 --> 06:55.199
It's not too late to fix this.

06:55.199 --> 06:56.879
They can't have found anything on us.

06:57.560 --> 06:59.000
They can't have, Master.

07:06.199 --> 07:07.399
That's strange.

07:07.600 --> 07:09.360
You're the one who extorted bribes
from salt merchants.

07:09.879 --> 07:11.240
What's that got to do with me?

07:12.920 --> 07:14.079
The Salt Transport Bureau

07:14.360 --> 07:16.399
has always issued salt permits
by the book.

07:16.519 --> 07:18.720
Every one of them is properly recorded.

07:19.519 --> 07:20.839
Whatever you did on your own,

07:20.839 --> 07:22.399
whatever gifts and bribes you took,

07:22.399 --> 07:23.800
how would I know about any of it?

07:24.360 --> 07:25.160
Besides,

07:25.639 --> 07:26.639
did any of those things

07:26.800 --> 07:27.920
ever

07:28.160 --> 07:29.360
end up in my storeroom?

07:30.040 --> 07:31.480
Weren't they all put down

07:31.480 --> 07:33.360
as our daughters' dowries?

07:34.199 --> 07:35.399
Yan,

07:35.720 --> 07:38.000
you're really leaving me
to take the fall now?

07:38.879 --> 07:39.800
All these years,

07:40.439 --> 07:42.079
I was your go-between,

07:42.519 --> 07:44.240
cleaned up your messes
and collected your gold and silver.

07:44.240 --> 07:45.279
Every coin that passed through my hands,

07:45.279 --> 07:47.120
you handed over to your mistress.

07:48.600 --> 07:50.120
Aside from these few things,

07:50.720 --> 07:53.800
what did you ever leave
our daughters or me?

07:56.920 --> 07:59.639
Did you ever actually see me
take your money

07:59.839 --> 08:01.120
and give it to some mistress?

08:01.839 --> 08:02.839
Can you prove it?

08:03.160 --> 08:03.600
You...

08:03.600 --> 08:04.759
We all have our lot in life.

08:05.160 --> 08:06.839
If you could've given me a son,

08:07.199 --> 08:08.759
I wouldn't have needed another woman.

08:13.560 --> 08:14.879
Yan!

08:31.759 --> 08:33.200
Give us a little more time, sir.

08:34.000 --> 08:36.000
Once we know where things stand,

08:36.000 --> 08:37.000
we can still turn this around.

08:37.120 --> 08:38.000
It's too late.

08:38.720 --> 08:40.080
Our cover's blown.

08:40.200 --> 08:41.320
Madam Yan will never

08:41.320 --> 08:42.440
do business with you again.

08:42.879 --> 08:44.120
We'll have to move openly now,

08:44.279 --> 08:45.919
arresting them first
and questioning them later.

08:46.240 --> 08:47.879
By now, the books
may already be doctored.

08:48.440 --> 08:50.159
We were careful every step of the way.

08:51.000 --> 08:52.399
How did they figure us out?

08:52.639 --> 08:54.000
His Highness isn't blaming you.

08:54.799 --> 08:55.840
From here on,

08:56.120 --> 08:57.279
leave it to us.

08:57.840 --> 08:59.759
Don't give up just yet, sir.

09:00.399 --> 09:02.159
We've tipped them off,

09:02.519 --> 09:03.720
but that may not be

09:03.879 --> 09:04.759
a bad thing for us.

09:05.960 --> 09:07.559
Madam Yan has done plenty of dirty work,

09:07.559 --> 09:09.440
but to Lord Yan, she's still expendable.

09:10.039 --> 09:11.720
She must be terrified right now.

09:12.320 --> 09:13.840
Give her what she needs,

09:13.840 --> 09:15.480
and we can turn her to our side.

09:18.679 --> 09:19.799
How?

09:20.279 --> 09:21.799
(Madam Yan took all those risks)

09:22.200 --> 09:23.960
(for the sake of her three daughters.)

09:25.559 --> 09:27.480
(That's where we start.)

09:28.200 --> 09:29.240
(That gives us an opening.)

09:33.159 --> 09:33.879
My Lady.

09:33.960 --> 09:34.840
Look at this.

09:34.840 --> 09:35.519
Isn't it pretty?

09:35.919 --> 09:37.039
Who would've thought

09:37.200 --> 09:38.519
the great Jiuweijiao

09:38.679 --> 09:39.960
would become the court's lapdog?

09:40.279 --> 09:42.440
Since you already know
who we really are,

09:42.720 --> 09:44.519
you must know there's no escaping this.

09:45.120 --> 09:46.879
The Crown Prince is investigating
the Yan family.

09:46.879 --> 09:49.000
This isn't going to simply go away.

09:49.080 --> 09:50.159
You have no evidence.

09:50.440 --> 09:51.480
You think a few accusations

09:51.600 --> 09:52.799
are enough to convict me?

09:53.159 --> 09:54.879
That depends on what the Ministry
of Justice gets out of you.

09:55.639 --> 09:56.919
From what I hear,

09:56.919 --> 09:58.080
everyone confesses eventually.

09:58.559 --> 09:59.240
After all,

09:59.600 --> 10:01.559
abusing official power
to sell salt permits for profit

10:01.879 --> 10:02.639
not only

10:02.639 --> 10:03.720
undermines the salt laws,

10:03.879 --> 10:04.600
it also

10:04.600 --> 10:05.600
harms the people.

10:05.919 --> 10:06.639
By law,

10:06.639 --> 10:08.799
it's a grave crime of treason.

10:09.360 --> 10:10.399
A conviction means

10:10.399 --> 10:11.440
ruin for your entire family.

10:11.639 --> 10:13.320
And your three precious daughters

10:13.320 --> 10:15.080
could be reduced to official courtesans.

10:16.320 --> 10:17.279
Let me see!

10:17.519 --> 10:18.679
Why'd you take mine?

10:20.039 --> 10:20.559
My Lady!

10:20.559 --> 10:21.120
Give it back!

10:21.399 --> 10:22.159
Come here!

10:23.000 --> 10:23.480
No!

10:23.480 --> 10:24.360
Give it to me!

10:27.440 --> 10:28.559
Every mother

10:29.080 --> 10:30.559
wants to protect her daughters.

10:31.320 --> 10:32.039
I know

10:32.240 --> 10:33.720
you don't want it to come to that.

10:34.399 --> 10:36.279
If you cooperate now,

10:36.639 --> 10:38.480
there's still a way to make amends.

10:39.440 --> 10:40.759
Give us a sworn statement

10:40.759 --> 10:41.799
implicating Lord Yan.

10:42.639 --> 10:44.879
I'll ask the Crown Prince for mercy

10:45.399 --> 10:47.279
and keep your three daughters
out of this.

10:49.559 --> 10:50.360
You

10:51.200 --> 10:52.759
lied to me once already.

10:53.559 --> 10:54.960
Why should I trust you now?

10:55.639 --> 10:56.519
Tell me.

10:57.759 --> 10:58.799
If this all comes out,

10:59.440 --> 11:00.720
what do you think Lord Yan will do?

11:03.000 --> 11:04.200
He'll put

11:05.120 --> 11:06.399
every last crime

11:06.919 --> 11:08.240
squarely on you.

11:10.759 --> 11:11.720
And then,

11:12.919 --> 11:14.799
you may never get another chance

11:14.799 --> 11:15.840
to save your three daughters.

11:25.039 --> 11:25.799
Stop!

11:26.759 --> 11:27.720
Don't run!

11:27.720 --> 11:28.720
You can't see mine either!

11:29.120 --> 11:29.840
Slow down!

11:31.440 --> 11:32.360
Stop right there!

11:35.120 --> 11:36.320
(Sworn Statement)

11:36.879 --> 11:38.159
(Testimony of Madam Yan, nee Jiang)

11:39.000 --> 11:40.960
(Since the thirteenth year of Dacheng,)

11:41.279 --> 11:42.240
(I was coerced by my husband,)

11:42.639 --> 11:44.840
(Commissioner of the Western Capital
Salt Transport Bureau,)

11:45.080 --> 11:46.559
(Yan Shouzheng,)

11:47.000 --> 11:48.240
(to sell salt permits illegally.)

11:49.960 --> 11:51.159
(Details of all payments)

11:51.639 --> 11:52.840
(are recorded in the secret ledger.)

11:53.480 --> 11:55.120
(The funds held in his mistress's name)

11:55.360 --> 11:56.840
(all came
from illegal salt-permit sales.)

11:57.679 --> 11:59.600
(Sworn Statement)
(I acknowledge my own guilt)

12:01.879 --> 12:03.399
(and hereby name
the salt merchants involved.)

12:03.919 --> 12:05.600
(I humbly ask
that the principal offender be punished)

12:06.720 --> 12:07.960
(to uphold the law.)

12:07.960 --> 12:10.760
(Observe Goodness, Cultivate Virtue)

12:10.760 --> 12:12.960
(Yongning Prefectural Yamen)

12:22.600 --> 12:23.559
(Arrest Warrant)
We're here to search.

12:24.159 --> 12:24.919
It's a mistake.

12:25.360 --> 12:26.600
Officer, you must have got it wrong.

12:28.039 --> 12:29.120
We have

12:31.919 --> 12:33.159
a salt permit.

12:33.919 --> 12:35.399
You've gone through a lot, gentlemen.

12:36.480 --> 12:37.679
Save it.

12:38.039 --> 12:39.600
That permit is exactly why we're here.

12:39.720 --> 12:41.360
That gold ingot Madam Yan has...

12:41.799 --> 12:42.840
You gave it to her, didn't you?

12:44.120 --> 12:45.279
Orders from above.

12:46.240 --> 12:48.000
All profits from the salt trade
are confiscated,

12:48.000 --> 12:49.240
and you pay a fine.

12:49.679 --> 12:50.519
Otherwise,

12:51.320 --> 12:52.720
it's exile under the law.

12:53.559 --> 12:54.120
But...

12:57.000 --> 12:58.919
I only just got that salt permit.

12:59.200 --> 13:00.559
I haven't even made my money back.

13:00.879 --> 13:02.440
How am I supposed to pay the fine?

13:03.039 --> 13:05.440
If I can't raise the money,
we'll be exiled.

13:08.559 --> 13:09.279
Mr. Jin,

13:09.559 --> 13:10.320
the truth is,

13:10.679 --> 13:12.200
that salt-permit business

13:12.960 --> 13:14.759
wasn't really our doing.

13:18.639 --> 13:20.480
When we left Huaying,

13:21.639 --> 13:23.159
we swore to share

13:23.159 --> 13:25.720
both fortune and misfortune.

13:25.720 --> 13:26.080
Well,

13:26.279 --> 13:27.799
we've hardly had any fortune to share.

13:28.440 --> 13:29.840
It's every man for himself.

13:30.159 --> 13:31.519
You can't blame us for that.

13:31.960 --> 13:32.799
Besides,

13:33.360 --> 13:34.320
isn't that

13:35.000 --> 13:36.840
exactly what you did to Mr. Zhao?

13:37.080 --> 13:38.039
Exactly.

13:44.600 --> 13:45.399
Try to understand.

13:47.679 --> 13:48.440
Sorry.

13:54.360 --> 13:55.880
(Yongning Prefectural Yamen)

14:03.440 --> 14:04.879
Take all these salt merchants away.

14:05.000 --> 14:05.679
Yes, sir.

14:06.840 --> 14:07.360
Get up!

14:08.440 --> 14:08.840
Move!

14:10.600 --> 14:11.039
Go!

14:17.039 --> 14:17.720
General Mo.

14:19.360 --> 14:20.320
What brings you here?

14:20.799 --> 14:21.480
What's wrong?

14:22.320 --> 14:23.440
Is there a man in here

14:24.440 --> 14:25.960
named Jin Yuanbao?

14:27.200 --> 14:29.360
Jin Yuanbao...

14:29.480 --> 14:30.600
Let me check.

14:32.080 --> 14:32.840
Yeah, we've got him.

14:33.879 --> 14:34.840
He won't pay the fine,

14:34.840 --> 14:35.759
and no one's paid it for him.

14:35.840 --> 14:36.720
He's waiting to be exiled.

14:37.519 --> 14:38.039
Why?

14:39.679 --> 14:40.519
I'll pay it for him.

14:41.120 --> 14:42.120
You?

14:43.279 --> 14:44.759
What's he to you?

14:45.039 --> 14:46.840
That's going to cost you a lot.

14:48.279 --> 14:49.559
Whatever it costs.

14:50.480 --> 14:51.440
Back then...

14:54.799 --> 14:55.919
We were like brothers.

14:57.799 --> 14:59.039
Well, well.

14:59.399 --> 15:00.480
That's loyal of you.

15:01.200 --> 15:02.120
I appreciate it, General.

15:03.600 --> 15:04.919
Come on. I'll take you to see him.

15:04.919 --> 15:06.639
Might as well see
what you're paying for.

15:12.000 --> 15:12.559
All right.

15:13.720 --> 15:15.000
Now that's a good man.

15:26.559 --> 15:27.720
Miss Xie,

15:27.720 --> 15:28.559
thank you for doing this.

15:29.240 --> 15:30.639
No need to thank me, Madam Yan.

15:32.480 --> 15:33.480
There's still

15:34.759 --> 15:36.279
one thing I don't understand.

15:37.000 --> 15:37.759
What is it?

15:38.159 --> 15:39.000
That day,

15:39.200 --> 15:40.840
did I give myself away somehow?

15:41.639 --> 15:43.759
Why did you suddenly pull out?

15:44.399 --> 15:45.360
It wasn't your mistake.

15:46.279 --> 15:48.440
It was those flower cakes from Madam Yu.

15:50.480 --> 15:52.360
You're clever, Miss Xie.

15:52.960 --> 15:54.799
Too bad you're still a woman.

15:57.039 --> 15:58.039
Since ancient times,

15:58.559 --> 15:59.919
a father's legacy passes to his son,

16:00.200 --> 16:01.519
a brother's to his brother.

16:02.080 --> 16:03.600
Never to a wife or daughter.

16:03.919 --> 16:06.080
Just look at my three daughters.

16:06.759 --> 16:07.759
In the end,

16:08.000 --> 16:09.960
everything I did for them
came to nothing.

16:10.639 --> 16:13.240
But why must a woman wait to inherit

16:13.679 --> 16:15.240
what she could earn for herself?

16:15.440 --> 16:16.679
There may be rules holding us back,

16:17.320 --> 16:19.279
but rules can be broken.

16:20.200 --> 16:21.320
All the more reason for a woman

16:21.440 --> 16:23.120
to keep her wits about her.

16:23.399 --> 16:25.159
Rather than waste her life
waiting for nothing,

16:25.519 --> 16:27.320
she can make her own way

16:27.679 --> 16:29.120
and use her own abilities

16:29.200 --> 16:30.559
to build a life for herself.

16:32.879 --> 16:34.159
You've got ambition.

16:35.519 --> 16:36.679
But this world

16:37.240 --> 16:39.000
has never lacked remarkable women.

16:40.159 --> 16:42.039
You could own countless mansions

16:42.039 --> 16:43.159
and mountains of gold and silver,

16:43.720 --> 16:44.759
but you couldn't keep them.

16:45.039 --> 16:45.840
Why not?

16:46.639 --> 16:47.399
Let me ask you.

16:48.519 --> 16:50.159
When some thug eyes your wealth

16:50.480 --> 16:52.080
and breaks in to take it,

16:52.320 --> 16:53.279
what would you do?

16:54.120 --> 16:56.240
I'd hire strong, capable men

16:56.600 --> 16:57.840
to guard my home.

16:57.840 --> 16:58.840
And what if one day

16:59.279 --> 17:00.720
you take a husband?

17:01.159 --> 17:03.000
Everything you've worked so hard for

17:03.240 --> 17:04.559
becomes your dowry

17:04.960 --> 17:06.279
and part of his family's property.

17:06.400 --> 17:07.240
Then

17:07.480 --> 17:08.759
what will you do?

17:09.759 --> 17:10.880
Then I simply won't marry.

17:11.039 --> 17:12.480
And what if someday

17:12.480 --> 17:15.119
the men of the Fu family learn
you're still alive

17:15.240 --> 17:16.759
and claim, in the family's name,

17:16.960 --> 17:19.359
that everything you own belongs to them?

17:22.359 --> 17:23.759
That's the law.

17:26.160 --> 17:27.839
It recognizes sons as the heirs.

17:28.480 --> 17:30.480
In the end, you still need a man.

17:31.279 --> 17:33.200
Even if you choose carefully

17:33.799 --> 17:35.559
and find someone like Zhao Ling,

17:36.279 --> 17:37.440
for the rest of your life,

17:37.880 --> 17:39.720
you'll have to keep one eye on him.

17:39.920 --> 17:40.640
Otherwise,

17:41.039 --> 17:42.200
you'll end up

17:43.240 --> 17:44.279
exactly where I am today.

17:46.480 --> 17:47.279
That is

17:47.720 --> 17:48.920
a woman's lot.

17:51.519 --> 17:52.839
Thank you for the warning, Madam.

17:55.079 --> 17:56.559
You've trusted me with the truth.

17:57.640 --> 17:59.400
I promise your daughters
will be protected.

17:59.920 --> 18:00.720
You have my word.

18:14.920 --> 18:16.799
(Miss Xie, you're a clever woman.)

18:17.759 --> 18:18.880
(So take this advice from me.)

18:20.440 --> 18:21.119
(A woman)

18:21.720 --> 18:23.720
(should never give anyone
her whole heart.)

18:24.960 --> 18:26.119
(Only self-interest)

18:26.640 --> 18:27.839
(will never betray you.)

18:31.720 --> 18:32.359
How did it go?

18:33.960 --> 18:35.559
Madam Yan pulled out at the last minute,

18:36.000 --> 18:37.079
but it wasn't our mistake.

18:37.599 --> 18:39.240
The leak came from the Yu family.

18:41.440 --> 18:42.799
That explains it.

18:57.839 --> 18:58.920
What are you up to now?

18:59.119 --> 19:00.079
Saving your life.

19:00.880 --> 19:01.680
Cut it out.

19:01.960 --> 19:02.799
Before,

19:03.440 --> 19:04.759
all I cared about was money.

19:05.559 --> 19:06.680
I trusted the wrong people

19:07.839 --> 19:08.759
and misjudged you.

19:08.839 --> 19:10.279
I don't owe you money anymore,

19:10.519 --> 19:11.519
and I don't owe you a favor.

19:12.079 --> 19:13.400
So spare me the speech.

19:13.799 --> 19:14.920
If our paths cross again,

19:16.440 --> 19:17.359
we'll owe each other nothing.

19:20.880 --> 19:21.720
Zhao Ling!

19:29.920 --> 19:31.119
I, Jin Yuanbao,

19:31.720 --> 19:33.400
will always regard you as my brother!

19:35.920 --> 19:37.279
Let this be my pledge.

19:37.839 --> 19:39.119
I'll never make the same mistake again!

19:44.720 --> 19:46.759
(Yu Residence)

19:46.759 --> 19:48.319
Jingxiu has two branches of the family
to carry on.

19:48.319 --> 19:49.759
His marriage is no small matter.

19:50.359 --> 19:51.680
Nothing can be left to chance.

19:53.920 --> 19:55.119
On the guest list,

19:55.359 --> 19:57.119
every prominent family in Yongning,

19:57.359 --> 19:58.519
every friend and relative...

19:58.680 --> 20:00.000
not one can be left out.

20:00.480 --> 20:02.599
The wedding feast should run
for at least three days.

20:03.119 --> 20:05.440
The first day for his fellow officials,

20:05.960 --> 20:08.079
the second for friends and family,

20:08.079 --> 20:08.920
and the third

20:09.559 --> 20:10.960
for the local folks.

20:12.240 --> 20:13.079
Madam,

20:14.279 --> 20:15.279
perhaps we could invite

20:16.319 --> 20:17.599
His Highness

20:18.039 --> 20:19.240
to the wedding banquet.

20:22.960 --> 20:25.240
You've kept His Highness's investigation
at the separate courtyard

20:25.559 --> 20:27.319
completely secret until now.

20:27.559 --> 20:28.880
But the case is over,

20:29.359 --> 20:30.680
so there's no need to hide it anymore.

20:31.160 --> 20:33.319
If we invite His Highness

20:33.519 --> 20:35.759
and Young Master gets even a few words
with him,

20:36.400 --> 20:37.559
it could only help

20:38.160 --> 20:39.200
with his future examinations.

20:46.319 --> 20:47.960
If you truly want to,

20:48.200 --> 20:49.799
send over some wedding cakes.

20:50.319 --> 20:51.839
Whether His Highness attends or not,

20:52.200 --> 20:53.839
receiving even a gift
from the royal household

20:54.119 --> 20:56.319
would be a great honor
for the Yu family.

20:56.960 --> 20:57.640
Yes.

20:59.400 --> 21:00.039
Madam,

21:00.119 --> 21:01.079
an honored guest has arrived.

21:05.279 --> 21:06.720
Welcome, Your Highness.

21:07.279 --> 21:08.559
I'm afraid there's been
a misunderstanding, Madam.

21:08.680 --> 21:10.000
His Highness is occupied elsewhere.

21:10.359 --> 21:11.319
He sent me

21:11.680 --> 21:12.880
to escort a friend here.

21:20.759 --> 21:21.640
Madam Yu.

21:22.119 --> 21:24.240
I hear there's
to be a wedding here soon.

21:24.720 --> 21:26.240
You've shown me great kindness before,

21:26.440 --> 21:28.039
so I've brought a wedding gift.

21:35.839 --> 21:38.279
Madam Yan saw those flower cakes

21:38.440 --> 21:39.759
at Miss Fan's poetry gathering

21:40.440 --> 21:42.640
and recognized them as something served
only in the palace.

21:43.160 --> 21:46.119
It nearly compromised His Highness's
entire salt reform operation.

21:49.079 --> 21:50.440
Please believe me, Miss Xie.

21:51.119 --> 21:52.839
I truly knew nothing about this.

21:53.200 --> 21:54.039
From now on,

21:56.160 --> 21:57.839
I'll make sure it never happens again.

21:59.680 --> 22:01.240
This can be taken one of two ways.

22:02.480 --> 22:03.680
At best,

22:03.920 --> 22:05.279
it was an innocent mistake,

22:05.559 --> 22:07.599
a failure to keep

22:07.599 --> 22:08.599
your household in line.

22:09.359 --> 22:11.640
The Sixteenth Master may let it go

22:11.640 --> 22:12.599
for old times' sake.

22:14.720 --> 22:16.319
But at worst...

22:16.640 --> 22:18.039
Miss Xie, you are

22:18.039 --> 22:19.880
one of the Sixteenth Master's
most trusted people.

22:21.680 --> 22:22.880
What do you want?

22:24.119 --> 22:25.640
You are clever, Madam.

22:28.200 --> 22:30.920
Help me obtain one thing I want,

22:32.279 --> 22:33.359
and this matter

22:34.279 --> 22:36.079
will never be mentioned again.

22:41.200 --> 22:43.160
When Zuo Junjie falsely accused me,

22:44.359 --> 22:45.559
his accusations were baseless,

22:45.559 --> 22:46.839
yet I had no way to defend myself

22:48.799 --> 22:51.039
because someone I trusted dearly

22:52.240 --> 22:53.720
gave false testimony for him.

23:01.799 --> 23:02.480
Madam,

23:03.240 --> 23:04.480
please...

23:09.440 --> 23:11.960
Since you two old friends
have some catching up to do,

23:13.880 --> 23:15.240
take her there.

23:28.119 --> 23:30.079
The Yu family needs something
from me now.

23:30.720 --> 23:32.319
If you want to keep this marriage

23:32.519 --> 23:33.680
and preserve your dignity,

23:34.200 --> 23:35.839
sign this written confession.

23:58.240 --> 24:01.200
(Declarant: Fan Yake)

24:03.079 --> 24:05.359
On the night of the poetry gathering,

24:05.960 --> 24:08.279
did Tingyun come to see you?

24:08.400 --> 24:09.160
No.

24:11.080 --> 24:13.560
(Signature of Declarant: Fan Yake)

24:19.480 --> 24:20.160
Press your thumb.

24:27.160 --> 24:27.960
Tingyun.

24:28.559 --> 24:29.640
I'm begging you.

24:32.359 --> 24:33.559
Let me go this once.

24:37.279 --> 24:38.279
Tingyun!

24:39.000 --> 24:40.200
Tingyun!

24:41.400 --> 24:43.279
Tingyun!

24:52.440 --> 24:53.640
(Signature of Declarant: Fan Yake)

25:00.520 --> 25:02.519
(Written Confession)

25:02.519 --> 25:04.039
You must be feeling pretty pleased
with yourself.

25:05.640 --> 25:06.880
From the very beginning,

25:07.880 --> 25:09.599
you never thought
I was worth anything, did you?

25:10.319 --> 25:11.839
People see

25:13.559 --> 25:15.000
what they already believe
in their hearts.

25:18.480 --> 25:19.920
I never looked down on you.

25:19.920 --> 25:21.359
You overthink everything

25:21.480 --> 25:22.920
until you trap yourself
in your own suspicions.

25:23.640 --> 25:24.799
When we were children,

25:25.200 --> 25:26.839
we truly cared for each other.

25:27.839 --> 25:29.599
That's why I never guarded myself
against you.

25:33.039 --> 25:33.839
Yake.

25:35.960 --> 25:37.559
I bear some blame for this too.

25:39.160 --> 25:40.400
I failed to understand

25:40.400 --> 25:41.960
what you kept hidden inside,

25:42.559 --> 25:44.079
and that left you feeling wronged.

25:45.519 --> 25:47.799
Maybe we were never meant
to walk the same path.

25:48.240 --> 25:49.599
Forcing ourselves to stay together

25:52.759 --> 25:54.160
would only make us both miserable.

26:00.920 --> 26:01.880
Fu Tingyun.

26:04.720 --> 26:06.319
So you finally admit it.

26:06.559 --> 26:08.079
You're Huaying's model young lady,

26:09.359 --> 26:10.680
born into a fine family.

26:12.400 --> 26:13.400
And what am I?

26:14.880 --> 26:16.599
I'll always be nothing but your shadow.

26:17.960 --> 26:19.480
You were born a magnolia,

26:20.039 --> 26:21.200
so pure and above all others.

26:21.720 --> 26:22.599
And me?

26:25.119 --> 26:27.000
I'm nothing but mud.

26:27.480 --> 26:28.720
If I don't cling to something higher,

26:28.720 --> 26:29.759
how else am I supposed

26:29.839 --> 26:31.440
to get ahead?

26:36.400 --> 26:38.079
Maybe I was born a magnolia.

26:38.960 --> 26:39.920
But that doesn't mean

26:39.920 --> 26:42.000
I deserve to be plucked
and trampled underfoot.

26:42.200 --> 26:43.759
And you've never stepped on anyone?

26:44.279 --> 26:46.079
Can you honestly say
you didn't use Madam Zuo

26:46.200 --> 26:48.440
and her chastity memorial arch
to raise your own standing?

26:49.119 --> 26:50.200
And my father.

26:50.880 --> 26:52.839
So what if he has students
throughout the land?

26:53.680 --> 26:56.079
You still used him to land yourself
a wealthy husband.

26:56.359 --> 26:57.400
You're right.

26:59.200 --> 27:01.200
And I've already paid the price for it.

27:01.599 --> 27:02.519
Now

27:04.480 --> 27:06.319
it's your turn to pay

27:06.319 --> 27:07.279
for what you've done.

27:15.440 --> 27:17.119
I stole your marriage from you.

27:19.920 --> 27:21.799
Now you've gotten what you wanted

27:23.559 --> 27:25.359
and ruined mine in return.

27:26.759 --> 27:28.319
I don't believe this marriage

27:28.319 --> 27:29.599
will take you anywhere higher.

27:31.720 --> 27:32.720
We're

27:33.920 --> 27:35.000
even now.

27:35.759 --> 27:37.039
I won't come after you again.

27:38.319 --> 27:40.160
You weren't the main culprit
in what happened at Huaying.

27:40.839 --> 27:42.759
Madam Zuo and her brother
were far worse.

27:43.680 --> 27:44.599
You lost your way

27:45.799 --> 27:47.640
because Madam Zuo planted
the seeds of it.

27:48.279 --> 27:50.079
One day, I'll settle things with her too

27:51.240 --> 27:53.039
and make her answer for what she caused.

27:56.240 --> 27:57.079
Don't worry.

27:58.759 --> 28:00.440
Your marriage will still go ahead.

28:01.640 --> 28:03.640
The Crown Prince has already seen
the wedding invitation.

28:04.039 --> 28:05.680
It's too late for the Yu family
to back out.

28:10.720 --> 28:12.279
You slandered me

28:12.279 --> 28:13.599
in front of my future mother-in-law.

28:13.960 --> 28:15.759
How can I ever have
a smooth path ahead?

28:17.480 --> 28:24.080
♪May all common folk share one roof,
every lantern rest in peace♪

28:25.079 --> 28:26.400
Even without me,

28:27.720 --> 28:29.160
your days ahead

28:30.160 --> 28:31.920
will never be smooth.

28:33.160 --> 28:36.400
♪I enter this game without regret♪

28:36.400 --> 28:39.040
♪Let the past remain beyond recall♪

28:39.040 --> 28:43.480
♪Trade it for boundless blue skies
to fly free and far♪

28:43.480 --> 28:44.680
The way Madam Yu looks at you

28:46.920 --> 28:48.759
is exactly how my grandmother
looked at Madam Zuo.

28:51.240 --> 28:51.960
Yake.

28:53.480 --> 28:54.480
Take care of yourself.

28:59.000 --> 29:00.279
Madam Zuo...

29:02.280 --> 29:08.000
♪With wit and strategy,
I enter this game without regret♪

29:08.000 --> 29:10.960
♪Though each move is forced upon me♪

29:10.960 --> 29:16.080
♪May it buy the world
one moment's peace from the storm♪

29:16.080 --> 29:21.600
♪I crave no clarity
from outside my soul♪

29:22.680 --> 29:23.680
Thank you, Madam.

29:24.319 --> 29:26.319
If you simply wanted to clear your name,

29:27.119 --> 29:28.880
you didn't need
to go to all this trouble.

29:29.079 --> 29:30.559
You could have just asked me.

29:30.880 --> 29:32.279
I wouldn't have refused.

29:34.839 --> 29:35.960
By doing this,

29:36.759 --> 29:39.359
you may have proven that Miss Fan
lacks virtue,

29:40.039 --> 29:41.240
but aren't you afraid

29:41.240 --> 29:42.799
you've made yourself an enemy?

29:43.000 --> 29:44.960
Even if I don't see you as an enemy,

29:46.039 --> 29:48.359
does that mean you won't see me as one?

29:52.480 --> 29:54.920
I only wanted
to build a good life for myself.

29:55.480 --> 29:57.759
But whenever I think
of what you've done,

29:58.039 --> 29:59.079
I can't feel at ease.

30:00.240 --> 30:02.319
I need something I can hold over you

30:03.200 --> 30:05.000
to make sure that from now on,

30:05.759 --> 30:07.599
we stay out of each other's way.

30:10.400 --> 30:13.079
So you weren't trying
to clear your name.

30:13.200 --> 30:15.720
You wanted something
to protect yourself,

30:16.400 --> 30:18.799
so no one
would dare push you around again.

30:19.359 --> 30:20.200
Exactly.

30:20.640 --> 30:22.519
But you're still on your own.

30:23.200 --> 30:24.519
Once this is over,

30:25.240 --> 30:26.680
where will you go?

30:38.200 --> 30:39.240
Got the written confession?

30:39.519 --> 30:40.119
Yes.

30:42.440 --> 30:43.839
My business is settled.

30:44.960 --> 30:46.759
Now I'd like to ask about you.

30:47.880 --> 30:48.480
Me?

30:49.039 --> 30:50.759
I'd like to offer some advice

30:50.839 --> 30:51.759
about what you should do next.

30:52.480 --> 30:53.119
I'm listening.

30:58.400 --> 31:00.240
Do you want to live rich for a while,

31:00.559 --> 31:01.960
or live in peace for good?

31:04.000 --> 31:04.920
Right now,

31:04.920 --> 31:06.880
everyone believes you are Jiuweijiao.

31:07.079 --> 31:08.559
By sheer luck,

31:08.759 --> 31:11.039
you've ended up at the top
of the salt-smuggling trade.

31:11.440 --> 31:12.440
But what you don't see

31:12.559 --> 31:14.759
is that all that wealth
has put a target on your back.

31:15.039 --> 31:16.799
Especially with the Sixteenth Master
watching.

31:17.359 --> 31:18.599
Once the salt case is closed,

31:18.920 --> 31:21.480
even what you've done
to help may not save you.

31:22.440 --> 31:23.079
You have a point.

31:23.559 --> 31:25.640
Instead of waiting for your enemies
to hunt you down

31:25.640 --> 31:26.880
or the court to come after you,

31:27.480 --> 31:30.240
turn over everything
that belongs to Jiuweijiao.

31:30.480 --> 31:32.720
The Sixteenth Master may reward you

31:32.720 --> 31:34.440
for what Zhao Ling has done.

31:34.680 --> 31:36.200
That's something
you can actually build a life on.

31:43.480 --> 31:44.200
What about you?

31:45.960 --> 31:46.839
What do you want?

31:48.279 --> 31:49.720
To tell the Sixteenth Master the truth,

31:50.599 --> 31:51.599
then return to the capital

31:52.359 --> 31:53.039
and find your mother?

32:00.000 --> 32:01.440
The world's wide open to you now.

32:04.240 --> 32:05.279
Take care of yourself.

32:10.240 --> 32:12.480
Your Highness, I wish to surrender
all of Jiuweijiao's holdings.

32:12.839 --> 32:13.799
Please review the accounts.

32:19.880 --> 32:21.640
These assets amount
to nearly one hundred thousand taels.

32:22.640 --> 32:23.839
They can be used for disaster relief

32:24.440 --> 32:25.920
to help those in immediate need.

32:26.720 --> 32:28.720
Truly brave and strong in arms,

32:28.920 --> 32:31.000
unyielding to the very end.

32:32.200 --> 32:33.119
Today,

32:33.319 --> 32:34.599
I see you in a new light.

32:35.240 --> 32:35.880
Zhao Ling.

32:36.039 --> 32:37.400
You rendered great service
in this investigation

32:37.519 --> 32:38.160
and deserve a reward.

32:38.519 --> 32:39.680
I've already decided.

32:39.960 --> 32:40.720
For your reward,

32:40.799 --> 32:41.960
take my visiting card

32:42.039 --> 32:42.960
and join the army.

32:49.839 --> 32:51.480
I'm grateful for Your Highness's favor.

32:53.799 --> 32:55.200
But I have no desire to join the army.

32:55.920 --> 32:57.160
I only want to be a salt merchant

32:57.720 --> 32:58.920
and live a quiet, steady life.

33:03.880 --> 33:05.359
You really are a reckless fool.

33:06.079 --> 33:08.200
Do you even understand
what His Highness's name carries?

33:09.240 --> 33:10.720
Think carefully.

33:10.720 --> 33:11.640
If you miss this chance,

33:11.720 --> 33:12.960
you may regret it for life.

33:13.079 --> 33:14.519
What a pity that would be.

33:14.680 --> 33:15.640
Join the garrison,

33:15.640 --> 33:17.319
and you'll have horses and firearms,

33:17.599 --> 33:19.039
and many chances to hone your skills.

33:19.160 --> 33:20.519
How could you not want that?

33:27.400 --> 33:28.160
You have three days.

33:28.319 --> 33:29.759
Think it over, and give me your answer.

33:32.000 --> 33:32.720
Zhao.

33:35.880 --> 33:36.680
Zhao.

33:37.000 --> 33:38.400
His Highness
is steadily gaining strength.

33:38.799 --> 33:41.279
One day, he will surely become
a wise and virtuous ruler.

33:41.680 --> 33:42.480
You're the first man

33:42.480 --> 33:44.359
of the martial world
he's personally sought to recruit.

33:44.480 --> 33:45.599
Think very carefully.

33:45.799 --> 33:46.680
Yes.

33:47.640 --> 33:48.759
Thank you for the advice.

33:49.359 --> 33:50.279
But I've made up my mind.

33:50.640 --> 33:51.480
No need to persuade me further.

33:52.279 --> 33:53.200
When we cross paths again,

33:53.480 --> 33:54.440
we'll have a chance to spar.

34:04.839 --> 34:05.960
Do you understand now?

34:06.279 --> 34:07.319
His Highness

34:07.319 --> 34:09.679
may seem to have given Zhao Ling
three days,

34:09.679 --> 34:12.239
but those three days are really for you.

34:12.320 --> 34:13.840
You'd better think of something

34:13.840 --> 34:14.559
and help His Highness

34:14.679 --> 34:16.280
keep such a valuable man.

34:29.039 --> 34:30.159
What's all this about?

34:30.719 --> 34:31.480
Mr. Zhao.

34:32.039 --> 34:33.360
I need to go home.

34:33.360 --> 34:35.639
My mother sent word
that she hasn't been well.

34:36.000 --> 34:36.840
Same here.

34:37.280 --> 34:38.440
I've been away for years.

34:38.440 --> 34:39.480
It's time I went home too.

34:41.880 --> 34:42.960
You should.

34:45.079 --> 34:45.920
Safe travels.

34:52.760 --> 34:53.559
We're off, Mr. Zhao.

34:53.559 --> 34:54.119
Go on.

34:58.239 --> 34:58.679
Let's go.

35:14.719 --> 35:15.559
Mr. Zhao.

35:33.400 --> 35:34.400
In a few days,

35:35.760 --> 35:36.800
I'm leaving too.

35:38.840 --> 35:39.880
After that,

35:41.280 --> 35:42.840
our paths will part.

35:53.079 --> 35:53.800
Take care.

35:55.480 --> 35:56.159
Take care.

36:01.640 --> 36:05.520
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye♪

36:05.520 --> 36:09.800
♪Will fill my eyes with tears♪

36:09.800 --> 36:12.760
♪Etched deep within my heart♪

36:12.760 --> 36:17.120
♪Yet buried without a word♪

36:17.120 --> 36:21.240
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

36:21.240 --> 36:25.880
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

36:25.880 --> 36:30.600
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

36:54.159 --> 36:55.880
Though this matter
could have been kept quiet,

36:56.320 --> 36:57.719
I could not ease my conscience,

36:57.719 --> 36:58.679
so I came to confess.

36:59.920 --> 37:01.000
My foolish daughter-in-law

37:01.400 --> 37:02.800
nearly jeopardized an important matter.

37:03.199 --> 37:04.719
Even death would not be enough.

37:05.079 --> 37:07.320
I beg Your Highness
to forgive her youthful recklessness.

37:07.559 --> 37:08.519
When I return home,

37:09.000 --> 37:10.760
I will discipline her strictly.

37:12.320 --> 37:13.920
I warned you long ago, Madam.

37:14.159 --> 37:15.440
When the true scripture
is finally obtained,

37:15.559 --> 37:16.920
you too may ascend the lotus throne.

37:19.760 --> 37:21.199
I failed to keep my household

37:21.199 --> 37:22.159
in order.

37:22.800 --> 37:24.159
I ask Your Highness to punish me.

37:29.239 --> 37:30.679
Rise, Madam Yu.

37:37.719 --> 37:38.840
Lord Yu

37:40.079 --> 37:41.639
is one of His Majesty's
most trusted ministers.

37:42.719 --> 37:44.239
Though you were careless,

37:44.760 --> 37:46.039
I won't be too harsh.

37:47.360 --> 37:48.840
But as for the salt administration,

37:50.000 --> 37:51.599
there can be no reward
for your contribution.

37:57.159 --> 37:58.559
It is the Yu family's duty

37:59.599 --> 38:01.360
to ease Your Highness's burdens.

38:02.920 --> 38:04.280
I would never dare claim credit.

38:07.440 --> 38:08.639
I shall take my leave.

38:20.440 --> 38:22.480
The most important thing
still isn't settled.

38:24.280 --> 38:25.360
If I'm going to marry,

38:25.800 --> 38:27.000
I'll make sure it's a grand affair.

38:27.639 --> 38:28.880
In three or five years,

38:29.320 --> 38:30.400
once my life is secure,

38:31.159 --> 38:32.039
all anyone will remember

38:32.039 --> 38:33.400
is that I'm the eldest young madam
of the Yu family.

38:34.079 --> 38:35.679
Who will remember
today's humiliation then?

38:36.719 --> 38:38.400
If I lose my nerve now,

38:39.000 --> 38:40.000
then I'm truly finished.

38:41.920 --> 38:43.559
Bring me the dowry list.

38:57.360 --> 38:58.400
How can this be?

38:59.800 --> 39:01.800
I can overlook the cabinets
not being made of expensive wood,

39:01.800 --> 39:02.719
but this vanity box...

39:03.199 --> 39:05.239
I'll use it every single day.

39:05.760 --> 39:07.239
How can it not be made
of huanghuali wood?

39:07.920 --> 39:09.480
People will laugh at me.

39:09.800 --> 39:10.840
Miss Fan,

39:10.920 --> 39:12.679
a single huanghuali vanity box

39:12.920 --> 39:14.960
costs at least a hundred taels
of silver.

39:15.639 --> 39:17.400
The more people look down on me,

39:18.079 --> 39:19.639
the more I have to keep up appearances.

39:20.559 --> 39:21.599
If we don't have enough silver,

39:22.440 --> 39:23.960
sell three more chests of manuscripts.

39:28.400 --> 39:30.960
(Next Episode)

39:31.760 --> 39:33.960
(It's never easy for a woman
to make her own way.)

39:34.599 --> 39:36.960
(If I must find one tree strong enough
to shelter me,)

39:36.960 --> 39:38.559
(you're the one I trust most.)

39:39.239 --> 39:40.599
Perhaps in this world,

39:40.599 --> 39:41.840
the strongest alliances are forged

39:42.320 --> 39:44.599
when sincere hearts
yield mutual benefit,

39:45.079 --> 39:46.199
and that benefit

39:46.480 --> 39:47.719
ripens into genuine affection.

39:47.840 --> 39:49.360
Bound by shared interests,

39:49.360 --> 39:51.239
we may rely on each other fully.

39:52.000 --> 39:53.480
Mr. Zhao, will you marry me?

39:54.000 --> 39:54.880
For you,

39:56.719 --> 39:57.760
marriage

40:01.079 --> 40:02.679
is nothing but a bond of interests

40:02.679 --> 40:03.800
and a path to advance your standing?

40:16.321 --> 40:20.641
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

40:24.241 --> 40:28.601
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

40:30.721 --> 40:35.361
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

40:35.601 --> 40:38.401
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

40:39.561 --> 40:44.201
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

40:47.401 --> 40:54.241
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

40:55.121 --> 41:01.641
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

41:02.601 --> 41:06.041
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

41:06.561 --> 41:10.761
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

41:11.041 --> 41:16.721
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

41:28.841 --> 41:32.721
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

41:36.641 --> 41:40.641
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

41:42.361 --> 41:47.041
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

41:47.361 --> 41:50.041
♪Kept close within my heart♪

41:51.121 --> 41:55.961
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

41:59.481 --> 42:06.401
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

42:07.281 --> 42:13.761
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

42:14.641 --> 42:18.161
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

42:18.601 --> 42:22.961
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

42:23.161 --> 42:28.881
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
